# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Script: git-delete-sync.sh
# Purpose: Synchronized deletion of local and upstream Git branches with safety checks.
# Logic Based On: 
#   - Git SCM Documentation (https://git-scm.com)
#   - POSIX/Bash Shell Execution Standards (set -euo pipefail)
# Created via: Generative AI Assistance (Anthropic/Google, September 2026)
